<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <title>Privacy Policy — Rizins Smash</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css?v=6" />
  <script src="/js/native-app.js?v=1"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1rem 3rem;">
    <div class="card" style="line-height: 1.6;">
      <h1 style="margin-top: 0;">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--muted);">Last updated: <%= updated %></p>

      <p>This policy explains how CRAVE COLLECTIVE HOLDINGS PTY LTD ("we", "us"), operator of Rizins Smash, handles personal information in the Rizins Smash staff app and website (rizinssmash.com). The app is for Rizins Smash employees and managers only. Accounts are created by management; there is no public sign-up.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account details:</strong> name, user ID, email address and role.</li>
        <li><strong>Employment and pay details:</strong> store, employment type, hourly wage, home address, bank BSB and account number, superannuation fund, tax rate, timesheets and payslips.</li>
        <li><strong>Work records:</strong> shift bookings, rosters, store checklists, cash submissions, maintenance reports and invoices.</li>
        <li><strong>Photos and videos</strong> that managers choose to upload with cash submissions or maintenance reports. The app only uses the camera when you choose to take a photo or video.</li>
        <li><strong>Device push tokens</strong>, used only to send you notifications you have allowed.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use this information only to run the business: rostering, approving shifts, calculating pay, producing and emailing payslips, managing stores and sending work notifications. We do not sell personal information, show advertising, or track you across other apps or websites.</p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>Information is visible only to you and to the managers who need it for their role. We use service providers to host the app (Amazon Web Services, Australia region), deliver notifications (Apple Push Notification service and web push services) and send email. We may disclose information where required by law, for example to the Australian Taxation Office.</p>

      <h2>Storage and security</h2>
      <p>Data is stored on servers in Australia and sent over encrypted (HTTPS) connections. Passwords are stored as one-way hashes. We keep employment and pay records for as long as Australian law requires, and delete other information when it is no longer needed.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under the Australian Privacy Act 1988 you can ask to access or correct your personal information, or ask questions about this policy. Contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= contactEmail %>"><%= contactEmail %></a>. If you are not satisfied with our response, you can contact the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner (oaic.gov.au).</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy and will change the date above when we do.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 2rem;"><a href="/support">Support</a> · <a href="/login">Log in</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
